  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Hosting remains a choice",
      "items": [
        "User direction: €0 first, local Compose and free best-effort web hosting; story 10.3 benchmarks memory, PDF peaks, startup and cold starts before Aymen chooses.",
        "Render + Neon and a single always-on VPS are candidate topologies, not activated providers. The diagram does not choose whether the database shares the application host. No current price or entitlement is asserted."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Delivery order",
      "items": [
        "Increment 1 CI: build, meaningful tests, CodeQL, secret scan and reproducible synthetic journey/isolation evidence. This diagram also includes the later release target.",
        "Promotion pipeline, SBOM/provenance/signing, Sonar projects and rollback rehearsal are deferred to increment 4 / D-29. They are not active application checks today."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Environment and recovery boundaries",
      "items": [
        "Dev, CI, preview and demo use separate databases, credentials, stores and fixtures. Tests must reject public-demo endpoints. Runtime packaging allowlists reviewed assets and excludes planning/design/tooling folders.",
        "Promote exact tested artifacts; apply compatible Flyway migrations once. Applied migrations stay immutable. Roll back a compatible image or forward fix; rehearse a separate DB/byte restore before switching."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Mobile and optional surfaces",
      "items": [
        "PWA uses the validated web build. The Expo Android app derives from the same validated commit as a development build or package file; iOS needs a Mac or the Apple program (Linux cannot build it); signing material stays outside Git. Store publication is not planned (D-15).",
        "The native app loads no remote page and no webview shows clinical content. An optional independent static showcase may use Cloudflare without moving the authenticated app to unrelated origins. Sleeping hosts cannot promise timely jobs or reminders."
      ]
    }
  ]
